sample space. The algorithm relies on the beam width pa- rameter 𝑘, which determines the number of top candidates retained at every step. During decoding, beam search ex- pands each candidate sequence in the beam by considering all possible tokens, computes their respective probabilities us- ing the LLM, and retains the top-𝑘most probable sequences out of 𝑘· |𝑉| candidates, where |𝑉| is the vocabulary size.",,,,,,
