ANN-0262,Q18,Explain Dual Encoder architecture,CAND-349281b41af4,papers/Bahdanau2014_Attention.pdf,3,,"Figure 1: The graphical illus- tration of the proposed model trying to generate the t-th tar- get word yt given a source sentence (x1, x2, . . . , xT ).
In a new model architecture, we deﬁne each conditional probability in Eq. (2) as:
p(yi|y1, . . . , yi−1, x) = g(yi−1, si, ci), (4)
where si is an RNN hidden state for time i, computed by
