Besides the computation in Eq. 4, all other components in the Transformer model, including the embedding layer, feed-forward layer, layer normalization [2], residual connec- tion [22], output logit computation, and the query, key, and value transformation in Eq. 2, are all applied independently position-wise in a form of 𝑦𝑖= 𝑓(𝑥𝑖).
