ANN-0456,Q32,Why are dual-encoders preferred over cross-encoders for first-stage retrieval?,CAND-46849b1b220a,papers/Lewis2020_RAG.pdf,3,,"The retrieval component pη(z|x) is based on DPR [26]. DPR follows a bi-encoder architecture:
