ANN-0476,Q33,How does re-ranking use cross-encoders after dense retrieval?,CAND-8dfaee82c4b2,papers/Karpukhin2020_DPR.pdf,4,5 Experiments: Passage Retrieval,"In this section, we evaluate the retrieval perfor- mance of our Dense Passage Retriever (DPR), along with analysis on how its output differs from
