Transformers [53] have become the de facto standard ar- chitecture for modeling the probability above at a large scale. The most important component of a Transformer-based lan- guage model is its self-attention layers. For an input hidden state sequence (𝑥1, . . . ,𝑥𝑛) ∈R𝑛×𝑑, a self-attention layer first applies linear transformations on each position 𝑖to get the query, key, and value vectors:
